Description: schematic editor and circuit simulator built with Qt6
 Circuit Master is a cross-platform schematic editor and circuit simulator
 written in C++17 with Qt6, covering the everyday Multisim workflow on Linux.
 .
 A paper-sized canvas (A5 to A1, either orientation) with drag-and-drop parts
 and pin-snapping wires; modified nodal analysis for DC, transient and AC
 sweep; static plots or a live oscilloscope; .csm JSON, PNG, PDF and printing.
 Autosave, crash recovery, tabs, English and Chinese.
